      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 - Telegram Bot\nOne bot, four jobs:\n- **/admin**: registers the store owner's chat for alerts\n- **/start ORDxxxx** (from the confirmation link): links the customer and shows Confirm / Cancel\n- **Button press**: confirms or cancels the order in Supabase\n- **Any other message**: AI support bot with order lookup, memory and tickets\n\nMust be **Published/Active** to receive Telegram messages.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "4d4c5bcb-e7d6-485f-a819-68fa7277e241",
